All right! All of Angelique's members assembled!

15:50.270 --> 15:54.140
Go south on Route No. 17, down Yamate street to the Government office

15:54.140 --> 15:56.360
And disband at midnight!

15:56.360 --> 15:57.350
Yes sir!

15:57.350 --> 15:58.320
Let's go!

16:03.440 --> 16:05.860
Why are we going along?

16:05.860 --> 16:08.810
Isn't it great? You need to rebel while you're young.

16:08.810 --> 16:11.090
Even you are having delusions, Umi-chan.

16:11.090 --> 16:12.700
What, me...?

16:15.100 --> 16:17.950
He's Kaizō...☆!

16:17.950 --> 16:20.950
Right, I should have delusions, too.

16:20.950 --> 16:23.040
World Domination

16:20.950 --> 16:24.520
All hail Suzu-sama!

16:24.520 --> 16:27.710
Suzu-sama!

16:25.330 --> 16:27.710
World Domination

16:30.630 --> 16:31.970
Me, too...

16:32.480 --> 16:35.660
Master, the car is waiting for you.

16:35.660 --> 16:37.430
All right, I'll be right out.

16:39.180 --> 16:42.580
Oh, today it's a Kiha 130?

16:42.580 --> 16:45.310
It's a car from the Hokkaido Hiraga line.

16:45.310 --> 16:49.850
The "Pony" Model. As I thought, local lines are bound to have some charm.

16:54.990 --> 16:57.020
We lost one in the back!

16:57.020 --> 16:58.140
What!?

17:02.120 --> 17:04.120
Chitan!

17:08.170 --> 17:10.170
We won't forget, for sure.

17:10.170 --> 17:12.130
Those wonderful times...

17:12.130 --> 17:16.610
Those days when our hearts would never stop pounding...

17:16.870 --> 17:21.720
Parting words from Tokimeki's founding president, Katsu Kaizō.

17:25.090 --> 17:29.080
Don't kill me off like that!

17:34.660 --> 17:39.450
In this school, there is a ghost story...

17:39.780 --> 17:43.970
In the closed-off pool of the north building, they say

17:43.970 --> 17:47.270
a student drowned in the olden days.

17:47.270 --> 17:50.180
But although he drowned

17:50.180 --> 17:54.210
the student's dead body never floated up.

17:52.210 --> 17:54.210
Do not enter

17:54.210 --> 17:59.540
All that came floating up were his bloody swimming trunks.

18:00.970 --> 18:04.600
The School Trunks

18:05.930 --> 18:07.440
Sciencevestigation Club

18:08.690 --> 18:15.780
Anal Prolapse

18:08.690 --> 18:13.700
Doesn't that make this about school trunks instead of school spooks?

18:13.700 --> 18:15.780
Chief, that's pretty vulgar.

18:15.780 --> 18:18.770
Ah, that's too frightening!

18:18.770 --> 18:21.280
Don't tell me scary stories like this!

18:21.280 --> 18:30.420
Anal Prolapse

18:21.280 --> 18:23.260
We're even going to the pool in gym today!

18:23.260 --> 18:25.510
I'm scared!

18:25.510 --> 18:27.920
It's rare for you to be scared.

18:27.920 --> 18:30.420
Aren't you just scared because you suck at swimming?

18:30.420 --> 18:33.380
You really can't swim, Kaizō-kun?

18:33.380 --> 18:35.250
What are you so happy about?

18:35.250 --> 18:39.380
<i>This is my chance! Swimming is actually my speciality!</i>

18:39.380 --> 18:51.060
Anal Prolapse

18:39.380 --> 18:41.960
<i>This is a chance to show everybody my true powers!</i>

18:41.960 --> 18:45.340
<i>And Kaizō-kun's position will take a turn for the worse!</i>

18:45.340 --> 18:49.230
What a surprise that you can't swim, Kaizō-kun!

18:49.230 --> 18:51.020
It's not that I can't swim!

18:51.020 --> 18:53.900
Don't cyborgs get rusty if they're immersed in water?!

18:54.980 --> 19:02.370
Anal Prolapse

18:54.980 --> 18:59.460
Professor, that's why I'd like you to add an underwater mode to my settings, please!

18:59.460 --> 19:02.370
So you want an underwater mode?

19:02.370 --> 19:03.370
On Land

19:02.370 --> 19:03.370
And Wood

19:04.120 --> 19:08.200
So this is the underwater mode? I've been upgraded!

19:08.200 --> 19:11.250
Not that it matters, but the letters are screwed up.

19:08.200 --> 19:11.250
TL Note: He wrote 木 (wood) instead of 水 (water)

19:11.250 --> 19:26.770
Anal Prolapse

19:11.250 --> 19:13.450
What's the new name for this?

19:13.450 --> 19:14.630
Name?

19:14.630 --> 19:17.610
If you get an upgrade, doesn't your name change?

19:17.610 --> 19:24.500
Like Z, or 01, or RX, or Dash, or Kai, or Dokkan, or Destiny, or Frontier...right?

19:25.100 --> 19:26.770
Then...

19:26.770 --> 19:29.390
Kaizō (H), how about that?

19:29.390 --> 19:31.800
What... (H)?

19:31.800 --> 19:35.020
That's cool, just like the Kiha 200!

19:35.020 --> 19:36.440
Are you a train-fan or something?!

19:36.440 --> 19:40.070
Crap, I got beat up!

19:40.070 --> 19:44.200
<i>But in a short while, my position will change!</i>

19:47.950 --> 19:52.330
There might be a buoy dividing us, but being in the same pool with the boys is embarrassing!

19:52.330 --> 19:54.620
Their looks are irritating, right?

19:56.460 --> 19:59.310
Huh? So you can swim?

19:59.310 --> 20:02.340
What? Didn't I just get an upgrade from the Professor?

20:02.340 --> 20:04.090
<i>The Placebo Effect?</i>

20:04.460 --> 20:07.100
<i>Oh well, he's still a beginner at swimming.</i>

20:07.340 --> 20:11.100
<i>Now is my time, I will show them how great my swimming is! </i>

20:11.100 --> 20:15.320
Say, somebody drowned in this pool before, right?

20:15.320 --> 20:17.070
Yeah, there's this rumor.

20:17.740 --> 20:19.070
<i>I forgot about that!</i>

20:19.070 --> 20:20.960
<i>This is scary!</i>

20:20.960 --> 20:23.770
<i>I can't even open my eyes under water like this!</i>

20:23.770 --> 20:32.720
At this time, with Kaizō unable to use his sight, his other senses, like hearing and smell, became enhanced.

20:32.720 --> 20:35.000
<i>That sound!</i>

20:35.400 --> 20:36.630
<i>It's the sound of urination!</i>

20:37.050 --> 20:39.130
<i>Somebody is urinating at the 4 o'clock position!</i>

20:39.410 --> 20:40.630
<i>I can't allow that!</i>

20:41.200 --> 20:42.870
<i>Burst on!</i>

20:45.120 --> 20:47.810
Watch! See how good my crawl stroke is!

20:48.180 --> 20:49.560
<i>Over there?</i>

20:51.970 --> 20:54.550
URINATOR!

20:58.270 --> 21:01.820
Underling! So you're the urinator?!

21:01.820 --> 21:03.070
What!?

21:03.070 --> 21:04.360
A urinator?!

21:04.360 --> 21:06.820
What are you, a grade schooler?

21:06.820 --> 21:08.570
Ew, that's the worst!

21:08.570 --> 21:10.870
You can't pee in the pool!

21:13.880 --> 21:18.750
<i>Instead of becoming a hero I was framed as a urinator...</i>

21:18.750 --> 21:23.380
<i>No! Once they see how great my swimming is, this misunderstanding will clear up!</i>

21:24.630 --> 21:27.640
Look! Look at this wonderful butterfly!

21:29.030 --> 21:32.560
Gaah, the motor won't stop!

21:32.800 --> 21:35.040
The Urinator's drowning.

21:35.040 --> 21:38.870
What's wrong, Chitan, can't you swim? You kidding?

21:38.870 --> 21:40.570
Of course I can swim!

21:40.570 --> 21:42.780
Just watch!

